igarda özgermes muhebbet bardur; Uningda zor nijatliqlarmu bar;"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["U Israilni barliq qebihlikliridin bedel tölep qutquzidu."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/uig_lat/PSA/130.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/uig_lat/PSA/131.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/uig_lat/PSA/129.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}